    "heading": "Skill",
    "lineStart": 13673,
    "lineEnd": 13675
  },
  "section": "8.132",
  "rulesText": "A skill is an area of specialization associated with an ability check. If you have proficiency in a skill, you can add your Proficiency Bonus when you make an ability check associated with that skill. See also “Playing the Game” (“Proficiency”)."
}
